<title>USA: Thermo Power Corp names new CEO.</title>
<headline>Thermo Power Corp names new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Power Corp said Wednesday it has named J. Timothy Corcoran chief executive and a director of the company.</p>
<p>Corcoran will continue to serve as president, a position he has held since April 1995, and president and chief executive officer of ThermoLyte Corp, a majority-owned subsidiary.</p>
<p>He replaces Marshall Armstrong, who will continue to serve as chairman of the boards of Thermo Power and ThermoLyte.</p>
</text>
